    "description": "Title\n: Mineral Rock Fragments w/Small Boxed Geologic Specimens Lot\nCondition\n: Used\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nDescription\n: Discover a fascinating assortment for collectors or educational use with this mixed lot of mineral rock fragments and small boxed geologic specimens. The set includes a selection of rough minerals in varied shapes and sizes, alongside individually boxed smaller geologic specimens that showcase diverse mineral types and crystal forms. Most pieces are unpolished, highlighting their natural characteristics, textures, and coloration  including quartz-like crystals, pale feldspar-type blocks, deep green rocky mineral chunks, and banded agate slices. Each boxed specimen is separated for easy viewing and handling, ideal for classroom study, hands-on geology lessons, or display. The rocks are visibly used, exhibiting surface dirt, minor chips, and natural edge irregularities inherent to raw samples. With its practical assortment and clear signs of prior educational use, this lot provides both value and character for hands-on collectors, teachers, or hobbyists interested in expanding their mineral collection with unique, varied samples. See images for details on condition and variety",
